From 8e1cba83909b1fc4198d27c745ddc7d2ab779471 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:23:57 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Expose a one-time firmware restart in Plasma Leave

Offer the firmware action only when logind allows it on a UEFI boot. Start an explicit Leave confirmation from the session runner and Kickoff. Schedule the firmware target before closing the session, report refusals in the greeter, and restore the previous target if logout is cancelled.

Assisted-by: Codex (gpt-6.2-sol)
